{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Ozzy was a revered dragon born with the mark of the triskelion on his forehead. This ancient symbol, representing the harmony of earth, sea, and sky, signified Ozzy's destiny as a guardian of balance and unity. As he grew in power and wisdom, Ozzy roamed the land, using his triskelion mark to heal rifts between warring factions and restore equilibrium to the forces of nature. His wings beat in a hypnotic rhythm, echoing the cycles of the triskelion, as he soared through the skies, a beacon of hope and harmony. Ozzy's legend spread, and creatures from far and wide sought his counsel, knowing that the triskelion's power flowed through him, bringing balance to a world in need.",
